# Supported Rust toolchain

The project is built and tested with the Rust stable toolchain. Any recent
stable release is supported; the CI configuration pins a recent stable.

# Build output

/target
Cargo.lock  # generated; do not commit binaries
Cargo.toml.bak

# Editor / OS cruft

**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE

.vscode/
.idea/
